\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \cb3 \strokec4 Chemistry 1015 3 minutes 23 seconds\cb1 \
\cb3 A significant.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf5 \strokec5 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \cb3 \strokec4 Chemistry 1015 3 minutes 27 seconds\cb1 \
\cb3 Enough.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf5 \strokec5 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \cb3 \strokec4 Chemistry 1015 3 minutes 29 seconds\cb1 \
\cb3 Reduction.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf5 \strokec5 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \cb3 \strokec4 Chemistry 1015 3 minutes 32 seconds\cb1 \
\cb3 Of the population.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf5 \strokec5 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \cb3 \strokec4 Chemistry 1015 3 minutes 40 seconds\cb1 \
\cb3 So, all three of these things.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf5 \strokec5 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \cb3 \strokec4 Chemistry 1015 3 minutes 44 seconds\cb1 \
\cb3 Must hold.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf5 \strokec5 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \cb3 \strokec4 Chemistry 1015 3 minutes 46 seconds\cb1 \
\cb3 in order for you to warrant use of the FPC.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf5 \strokec5 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \cb3 \strokec4 Chemistry 1015 4 minutes 2 seconds\cb1 \
\cb3 Because you could have a finite population, but then if you were to sample with replacement.\cb1 \
